[Expected Approach] Formula Based Method- O(1) Time and O(1) SpaceSum of first n natural numbers = (n * (n+1)) / 2For example: n = 5Sum = (5 * (5 + 1)) / 2 = (5 * 6) / 2 = 30 / 2 = 15How does this work?We can prove this formula using induction.It is true for n = 1 and n = 2For n = 1, sum = 1 * (1 + 1)/2 = 1For n = 4, sum = 4* (4 + 1)/2 = 10Let it be true for k = n-1.Sum of k numbers = (k * (k+1))/2Putting k = n-1, we getSum of k numbers = ((n-1) * (n-1+1))/2                 = (n - 1) * n / 2If we add n, we get,Sum of n numbers = n + (n - 1) * n / 2                 = (2n + n2 - n)/2                 = n * (n + 1)/2
